  "description": "The meme juxtaposes two types of religious head coverings — the nun's habit and the hijab — to highlight a perceived difference in how they are viewed. This is based on the assumption that one is 'acceptable' (nun's habit) and the other is 'offensive' (hijab), which is a form of religious bias and misrepresentation.",
